# The wide frame's: 发布包.zip opened from its card (MBUI_FIXTURE=chat-download; its stem and extension two words
# there), 下载 the page's button; closed (Esc) while it comes, its card saying how far (its sheet filling, the web's
# FileTile), kept once all of it is here.
timeout 20000
until =发布包
wait 600
tap =发布包
until =下载
wait 800
tap =下载
wait 1200
key esc
move -20 400
wait 4500
